# Expected OCR Reference

## expected_text

在这里填写人工转写文本。保留原始换行、列表层级和关键标点。

- 示例待办 1
- 示例待办 2

## must_include

- "会议"
- "待办"
- "2026-05-11"

## acceptable_variants

- "TODO" may appear as "To Do" or "待办".
- Full-width and half-width punctuation are both acceptable.
- Simplified/traditional Chinese variants are acceptable when meaning is unchanged.

## ignore_regions

- Page corner shadows.
- Decorative doodles that are not part of the notes.
- Crossed-out text marked as deleted.

## notes_for_reviewer

Use this file as the human reference when comparing generated Markdown. Mark a sample as failed when required numbers, dates, names, or checklist items are missing or materially wrong.
